      statConsequences: []
      displayTexts:
      - You peer at the group of men on the right. They are traitors to the Hands
        of Spawn. Terrible failures who deserve punishment. Why don't I try taking
        something from them? You sneak in and try to blend in. And you attempt to
        steal anything from their pockets.
      - You swiftly pickpocket one of the men in the group without anyone noticing.
        Out come currency and a note with a stamp of a crossed-out circle. The note
        reads, "To remember who we are, we must fight the titles imposed on us."
