        steal anything from their pockets.
      - They can sense your pickpocket before you even reach for anything. If only
        you were a little bit faster. Their previous stoic faces now scrunch with
        ferocity. "You steal on this sacred land? You gain from the suffering?" They
        retaliate as a group.
