  triggeredResponses: []
  UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts:
  - name_: Joy Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - 'You say your pleasantries to the men on the right wall, waiting their turn
      for the graveyard. They are solemn and stone-cold in your presence. One of
      them introduces himself. He explained they were the Uncounted, those disgarded
      from the hand of Spawns. '
    - '"We refuse to play this game. Refuse to reduce our stories to a pure number
      only to be reborn and do it again. You''ve only just come out of the chamber.
      You wouldn''t understand. You probably still don''t know how to use your body
      of yours."'
  - name_: Angry Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - 'You shout at the men on the right with obscenities that even you didn''t know
      were in your vocabulary. Despite a few glaring looks, they look unperturbed
      by your words. One even mutters, "Another one of those". Their indifference
      does not look like they were born by stoic strength but by defeated detachment,
      as shown by their sullen faces. '
    - '"Are you still learning to use this body of yours, or have you chosen to play
      this game? We refuse to have our stories be reduced to a pure number. Refuse
      to become the perfect vessel for these Spawns. Reborn to experience these over
      and over again. This is what it means to be one of the Uncounted."'
  - name_: Sad Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 1
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You let out a whimper to the men to the right. They nod in acknowledgement,
      as though they understood. A shared moment of misery. They introduced themselves
      as Uncounted. Those who refuse to abide by these rules of this labryinth. That
      their lives cannot be reduced to a mere number.
    - '"Come talk to us Uncounted whenever."'
  - name_: Fear Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 3
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You let out a fearful scream towards the men on the right wall. They remain
      unperturbed, still waiting for their turn at the graveyard prayer site.
  - name_: Joy Arm
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 0
    displayTexts:
    - You attempt to shake hands with the men waiting for the prayer site on the
      right wall. They don't acknowledge you.
  - name_: Fear Arm
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 3
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 0
    displayTexts:
    - You show your arm, which is jittery with nervousness. Some nod in acknowledgement.
      One holds your arm until it stops shaking.
  - name_: Angry Observation
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - 'You observe the men on the right wall. All with the same face and build, but
      different ages. Their bodies are marred by scars, and their clothes are torn
      and barely holding on. Their stench lingers a little too long. Waiting sullenly
      for their time at the graveyard prayer site. '
    - They repulse you for their insubordination. Some vague recollection returns.
      The Uncounted, you remember them as. People who reject the ideologies of the
      Labyrinth, who do not want to participate in bettering themselves. They would
      do better with their time improving their Value than pout like a bunch of whiny
      babies they are.
  - name_: Fear Observation
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 3
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - 'You observe the men on the right wall. All with the same face and build, but
      different ages. Their bodies are marred by scars, and their clothes are torn
      and barely holding on. Their stench lingers a little too long. Waiting sullenly
      for their time at the graveyard prayer site. '
    - 'You''re struck by a jolt of cold fear, immobilizing you for a moment. The
      Uncounted, your mind says. Unfamiliar to you, but there''s some vague recollection
      of this group. Those who are the mortal enemies of the Hand of the Spawn, the
      God of this Labyrinth. And they have the power to fight, not escape. "I best
      not get on their bad side". '
  - name_: Joy Observation
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - 'You observe the men on the right wall. All with the same face and build, but
      different ages. Their bodies are marred by scars, and their clothes are torn
      and barely holding on. Their stench lingers a little too long. Waiting sullenly
      for their time at the graveyard prayer site. '
    - 'The Uncounted! Your mind faintly remembers. Beyond that, you don''t remember
      anything more besides their rebellion against the Hand of the Spawns. You respect
      their fight against tyranny. Against being relegated to a mere number. We are
      people with unique experiences, not a pawn to the systsem.  '
  - name_: Sad Observation
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 1
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - 'You observe the men on the right wall. All with the same face and build, but
      different ages. Their bodies are marred by scars, and their clothes are torn
      and barely holding on. Their stench lingers a little too long. Waiting sullenly
      for their time at the graveyard prayer site. '
    - 'A sadness overwhelms you. How much the Uncounted has suffered needlessly,
      your mind says. You don''t truly understand what it means, but it continues.
      These Uncounted who fight against their destiny, against improvement, become
      so tortured through this process. Just embrace the warmth of the Hand of the
      Spawn, become its vessel, and all the suffering will ease away. '
  - name_: Fear Manipulate
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 3
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 5
    displayTexts:
    - You peer at the group of men on the right. Might they have some valuables you
      could steal? Their reputation as the Uncounted group precedes them. Your mind
      instantly targets the name "The Guardian", and it strikes a frozen fear through
      you. Best not to mess with them.
  - name_: Sad Manipulate
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 1
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 5
    displayTexts:
    - You peer at the group of men on the right. Might they have some valuables you
      could steal? It saddens you to think of their existence. To fight against the
      inevitable and all-powerful Hand of Spawns. This group of the Uncounted already
      cannot find enlightenment as the One True Vessel. You decide not to pickpocket
      from the already unfortunate.
  - name_: Joy Manipulate
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 5
    displayTexts:
    - You peer at the group of men on the right. Might they have some valuables you
      could steal? You think of their mission of greatness. To stand up against the
      might of the Hand of the Spawn. To protect the core humanity of people. It's
      best not to steal from those who are good.
